{
  "overview": "A production-oriented RESTful API boilerplate/generator (installed via a CLI) built on Express and Mongoose. It ships with JWT authentication and authorization, request validation, rate limiting, security headers, Mongo query sanitization, pagination, Docker support, and CI, intended as a starting point for real production APIs rather than a single-purpose demo.",
